								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=252.msg1067#msg1067">Re:For those that Hosed thier PoG faction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> June 03, 2003, 04:53:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
