								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							For me, it&#039;s a matter of I play a good character and I don&#039;t want to kill her. &nbsp;Kinda lame, I know, but I don&#039;t want to kill her. &nbsp; Now, if I had a evil char, which I don&#039;t, again lame, I would love to spread her blood all over that friggen tree, but since I&#039;m not, &nbsp;I will refrain. &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />And you can&#039;t fix the faction. &nbsp;The quest is a hoax, read the posted like to Ranger Glade.
